!! 0.1.4-beta.1 · 13 November 2026

* Removed generated `system N` suffixes from voice labels and ABC `V: name` headers.
* Short score labels use source abbreviations when available and are limited to 18 characters.
* A name is printed only once when multiple staves belong to the same MuseScore part.
* Original instrument names are preserved as `huwiki-import-original-instruments` on imported tiddlers.
* Existing ABC tiddlers remain untouched; re-import or edit their `V:` header lines if needed.

!! 0.1.3-beta.1 · 13 November 2026

* UI follows TiddlyWiki `$:/language` in Danish and English and keeps the current conversion choices when the language changes.
* Pickup-aware line layout: up to four full measures plus short pickup measures, including isolated 2/4 inside prevailing 4/4. Real alternating meters are distinguished from pickups.
* ABC source line breaks are honoured in preview; default of four full measures can be changed per file.
* Explicit MusicXML beam groups are tracked separately and MuseScore beam groups are preserved; source without beam metadata uses beat-based grouping.
* Merges adjoining repeat bars into `::` without introducing empty bars.

!! 0.1.2-beta.1 · 13 November 2026

* Native `$:/Import` hand-off, batch import (up to 20 files) and TiddlyWiki's own confirmation, renaming and duplicate handling.

!! 0.1.1-beta.1 · 13 November 2026

* Correct plugin packaging with metadata, readme/license/history tabs and icon.

!! 0.1.0-beta · 13 November 2026

* First browser converter of MSCZ/MSCX and MusicXML/MXL to ABC with ABCJS score preview.
